{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 30,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.4256591796875,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "the 4-month regimen. In all, 90% of the cost of medicines for the 2HPMZ/2HPM regimen comes",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        220.6519775390625,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "from the rifapentine component.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        102.18462371826172,
        527.5630493164062,
        116.73762512207031
      ],
      "text": "Equity:  Shorter-term and longer-term equity considerations were raised by GDG members. The GDG",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.985139846801758,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.49463653564453,
        527.4366455078125,
        129.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "considered that in the short term, issues such as access to rifapentine, the costs of rifapentine and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        128.69459533691406,
        527.4277954101562,
        143.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "increased pill burden (due to the lack of fixed-dose combinations for the 4-month regimen and the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.4419555664062,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "fact that rifapentine was dosed at 1200 mg) may decrease equity. However, in the longer term as",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09474182128906,
        527.3970336914062,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "costs reduce and access to rifapentine (including 300 mg tablets) increases, the shorter regimen is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        527.4212036132812,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "considered likely to increase equity for patients who will have a shorter period of time engaged with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.4947052001953,
        527.3826904296875,
        195.9376983642578
      ],
      "text": "the health system, potentially reducing costs associated with TB treatment, and who would be able",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69471740722656,
        184.26402282714844,
        209.13771057128906
      ],
      "text": "to return to work sooner.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        216.28863525390625,
        527.4102783203125,
        230.8416290283203
      ],
      "text": "Acceptability and feasibility:  Although patients and health-care workers may prefer a regimen of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        229.59864807128906,
        527.4421997070312,
        244.04164123535156
      ],
      "text": "shorter duration, GDG members were concerned at the pill burden relative to the standard 6-month",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        242.79859924316406,
        527.4398803710938,
        257.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "regimen and the potential need for fluoroquinolone DST in some settings with a high background",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.9987335205078,
        258.87701416015625,
        270.4417419433594
      ],
      "text": "prevalence of fluoroquinolone resistance.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.8159484863281,
        209.15652465820312,
        299.6679382324219
      ],
      "text": "Subgroup considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        306.87579345703125,
        527.4168090820312,
        321.3188171386719
      ],
      "text": "Subgroup analyses were conducted for four patient groups in order to inform the GDG discussions.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        320.0758056640625,
        527.41357421875,
        334.5188293457031
      ],
      "text": "The subgroup analyses presented to the GDG included people living with HIV infection, people with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        333.27581787109375,
        527.3915405273438,
        347.7188415527344
      ],
      "text": "diabetes mellitus, people with a low body weight (body mass index < 17.9 kg/m2) and people with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        346.4757995605469,
        527.1514282226562,
        360.9188232421875
      ],
      "text": "extensive disease (using a cut-off of >50% lung area affected) on chest radiography. The reported risk",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98178482055664,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        359.6758117675781,
        527.5525512695312,
        374.11883544921875
      ],
      "text": "differences for these subpopulations indicated no statistically significant differences when comparing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996549606323242,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        372.87579345703125,
        527.5225219726562,
        387.3188171386719
      ],
      "text": "the shorter regimen to the current standard of care; however, in some subgroups the overall numbers",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.979129791259766,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        386.0758056640625,
        527.3458251953125,
        400.5188293457031
      ],
      "text": "were small in both intervention and control groups (persons with HIV and those with diabetes mellitus).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.954004287719727,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        407.7796936035156,
        527.4046020507812,
        422.22271728515625
      ],
      "text": "Additional pharmacokinetic analyses being undertaken by the trial investigators will be available in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        420.9797058105469,
        527.3916625976562,
        435.4227294921875
      ],
      "text": "the future and may provide more nuanced information on drug exposures in these groups. Other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        434.1797180175781,
        527.1162719726562,
        448.62274169921875
      ],
      "text": "subgroup analyses that were part of the trial included analyses by age group, sex, presence of cavities",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.982035636901855,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        447.37969970703125,
        527.4234008789062,
        461.8227233886719
      ],
      "text": "on chest radiography, cavity size, WHO sputum smear grade, smoking history, Xpert Ct value and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        460.5797119140625,
        442.29107666015625,
        475.0227355957031
      ],
      "text": "Mycobacterial Growth Indicator Tube liquid culture automated system TTP (days).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        491.4236145019531,
        310.818115234375,
        507.0836181640625
      ],
      "text": "Subgroups included in the recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        514.29150390625,
        527.4212036132812,
        528.7344970703125
      ],
      "text": "The panel suggested that the shorter regimen can be used in the subgroups for which evidence was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        527.4915161132812,
        527.3881225585938,
        541.9345092773438
      ],
      "text": "available for review (people living with HIV infection, persons with diabetes mellitus, those with a low",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        540.6915283203125,
        527.4354248046875,
        555.134521484375
      ],
      "text": "body weight and those with extensive disease). However, the panel also emphasized that additional",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        553.8914794921875,
        416.5697937011719,
        568.33447265625
      ],
      "text": "research on the use of the shorter regimen in these subgroups is desirable.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        575.4855346679688,
        527.2848510742188,
        590.0385131835938
      ],
      "text": "People living with HIV infection:  The proportion of patients living with HIV infection in the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        588.7955322265625,
        524.3785400390625,
        603.238525390625
      ],
      "text": "intervention and control regimen arms was 8% and only patients with CD4 count above 100 cells/",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        601.9954833984375,
        527.4474487304688,
        616.4384765625
      ],
      "text": "mm  were enrolled. Of all the persons with HIV who participated in the trial (in all three arms), 95.4%  3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        615.1954956054688,
        527.3914794921875,
        629.6384887695312
      ],
      "text": "were receiving antiretroviral treatment (ART). HIV-positive persons not on ART at enrollment, had",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        628.3953857421875,
        527.5114135742188,
        642.83837890625
      ],
      "text": "planned initiation of efavirenz-based ART before or at study week 8. Persons with HIV were excluded",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999549865722656,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        641.5955200195312,
        527.502685546875,
        656.0385131835938
      ],
      "text": "from enrollment in the trial if, at the time of enrollment, their CD4-T cell count was known to be <100",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996649742126465,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        654.7955322265625,
        527.4417724609375,
        669.238525390625
      ],
      "text": "cells/mm . Overall, there were nine patients who were not on ART throughout the trial follow-up in  3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        667.9954833984375,
        527.4222412109375,
        682.4384765625
      ],
      "text": "the microbiologically-eligible analysis population (4.6%); the reasons for non-initiation of ART were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        681.1954956054688,
        115.03108978271484,
        695.6384887695312
      ],
      "text": "not clear.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        702.7894287109375,
        527.2684326171875,
        717.3424072265625
      ],
      "text": "People with diabetes mellitus : Additional information from pharmacokinetic analyses will be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        716.0994262695312,
        527.3969116210938,
        730.5424194335938
      ],
      "text": "available for this population in the future which may provide more nuanced evidence on the use of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        729.2994384765625,
        401.5525817871094,
        743.742431640625
      ],
      "text": "the intervention and control regimens in persons with diabetes mellitus.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
